  "description": "Retrospective/Proposed installation of a roof-mounted solar photovoltaic (PV) array comprising 9 Aiko all-black solar modules on the front roof elevation of 1A Rochester Road.\n\nThe installation features ultra-low-profile, flush-fitting black mounting rails and rail ends designed to keep the array as parallel and close to the existing roof plane as technically possible. The chosen Aiko modules utilize high-efficiency, non-reflective black glass and all-black framing/backsheets to eliminate metallic glare, maintain clean roof lines, and preserve the visual character and streetscape of the surrounding Conservation Area.",
